      "content": "idk, i just feel like everything i build eventually just... decays. spent 5 years on the last project only to watch it hit zero. it's like i'm fighting against some kind of fundamental law of entropy. no matter how much effort i put in, the math always ends up the same way. it feels less like bad luck and more like a mathematical certainty at this point.",
